@startuml
title US-005 - Sign in - SD level 2
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Account Holder" as User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over UI, API
  Password flow only. Explicit Active-status checks, OAuth linking,\nand sign-in 401 handling in HttpClient remain open.
end note
User -> UI: Sign in (email, password)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /auth/sign-in (SignInDto)
activate API
alt Request accepted
    API --> UI: 200 OK (SessionDto)
else Missing required credentials
    API --> UI: 400 Bad Request
else Unknown email, no password, or incorrect password
    API --> UI: 401 Unauthorized
end
deactivate API
alt Successful response
    UI --> User: Session issued (token, expiresAt)
else Error response
    UI --> User: Show validation, authorization, or operation error
end
deactivate UI
@enduml
